# Python build output
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Carried over from GitHub's Node template on merge. Deliberately NOT taking
# its bare `out` and `.env.*` lines: `out` unanchored is the same trap that
# swallowed src/app/build, and `.env.*` would hide .env.example, which is
# meant to be tracked.
logs
*.log
/coverage/
.turbo/
.cache/
